flutter_pcm_sound_spm
=====================

This package is a fork of flutter_pcm_sound
  https://pub.dev/packages/flutter_pcm_sound
  https://github.com/chipweinberger/flutter_pcm_sound

Original author: Chip Weinberger.

The original is released into the public domain under the Unlicense, which
places no condition on reuse — this credit is given because it is deserved,
not because it is required.

What is Chip Weinberger's work, essentially unchanged in this fork:

  lib/flutter_pcm_sound_spm.dart
  ios/flutter_pcm_sound_spm/Sources/flutter_pcm_sound_spm/*
  macos/flutter_pcm_sound_spm/Sources/flutter_pcm_sound_spm/*
  android/src/main/java/com/sadiqueiqbal/flutter_pcm_sound_spm/*

What this fork adds:

  * Swift Package Manager manifests for iOS and macOS, and the source layout
    Flutter's SPM integration expects.
  * The Android build compiling against Flutter's configured SDK rather than
    a pinned compileSdkVersion 33 — a fix that exists on upstream's master
    and has never been released.
  * minSdk 21, Java 17, a distinct Android package name, and `debugPrint` in
    place of `print` in the Dart logging.

If upstream adopts Swift Package Manager, use it instead of this.
